  "content": "<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zfojiw3.png\" alt=\"苦力怕革新 作品標記\">\n\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/W758n8u.png\" alt=\"苦力怕革新 苦力怕展示\">\n\n<div>\n    <p><br><br></p>\n    <center>\n        <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/52LU4mv.png\" alt=\"關於\">\n        <h4>苦力怕革新將原版的苦力怕替換為各種不同生態域特化的苦力怕類型，有些比其他的更友善 :)</h4>\n        <iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/XIf8yMA1V2U\"\n                title=\"YouTube 影片播放器\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"encrypted-media; picture-in-picture; web-share\"\n                allowfullscreen></iframe>\n    </center>\n</div>\n\n<div>\n    <p><br><br></p>\n    <center>\n        <h3>您可能也會感興趣</h3>\n    </center>\n    <center>\n        <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/creeper-overhaul\">\n            <img width=\"50%\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/OMlhHaU.png\" alt=\"苦力怕革新 材質包\">\n        </a>\n        <h5>由 lord_gogomines 製作的材質包，將苦力怕革新的苦力怕帶入原版 Minecraft！</h5>\n    </center>\n    <center>\n        <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/creeper-overhaul-overhaul\">\n            <img width=\"50%\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/jUxOI3S.png\" alt=\"苦力怕革新 再革新\">\n        </a>\n        <h5>由 wadoo154 製作的苦力怕革新粉絲動畫材質包</h5>\n    </center>\n</div>\n\n<div>\n    <p><br></p>\n    <center>\n        <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mnnbI3S.png\" alt=\"製作名單\">\n        <dl>\n          <br>\n            <dt>Josh/Joosh - 美術</dt>\n            <dt>ThatGravyBoat - 開發者</dt>\n            <dt>scratchy_sd - 所有苦力怕音效</dt>\n            <dt>ArkticBoi - 概念美術</dt>\n        </dl>\n    </center>\n</div>\n<div>\n    <p><br></p>\n    <center>     \n\n**<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZtjUq8p.png\" alt=\"我們的其他作品\">**\n\n[**Creatures and Beasts**](https://www.modrinth.com/mod/creatures-and-beasts) 為 Minecraft 添加驚人生物模組！<br>\n[**Critters and Companions**](https://www.modrinth.com/mod/critters-and-companions) 添加各種友善動物的模組！<br>\n[**Ghost**](https://www.modrinth.com/mod/ghost) 在你的世界裡新增兩種友善幽靈生物！<br>\n[**Golem Overhaul**](https://www.modrinth.com/mod/golem-overhaul) 新增 9 種鐵魔像類型的模組！<br>\n[**Enderman Overhaul**](https://www.modrinth.com/mod/enderman-overhaul) 徹底改革原版終界使者的模組！<br>\n[**Nightlights**](https://www.modrinth.com/mod/nightlights) 為 Minecraft 添加多種新光源的模組！<br>\n[**Lookin' sharp**](https://www.modrinth.com/mod/lookin-sharp) 在遊戲中新增 60 種近戰武器！<br>\n[**Ribbits**](https://www.modrinth.com/mod/ribbits) Ribbits 新增全新的沼澤村莊，住滿青蛙村民！\n<div>\n    <p><br></p>\n    <center>\n        <a href=\"https://discord.gg/sGwxnFV\">\n            <img width=\"10%\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/T4ltmGW.png\" alt=\"Discord\">\n        </a>\n        <a href=\"https://twitter.com/Joosh7889\">\n            <img width=\"10%\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ewzK3Zb.png\" alt=\"Twitter\">\n        </a>\n        <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCUvb1-kBGDEA1gVtd3UhlLg/videos\">\n            <img width=\"10%\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EirVdtZ.png\" alt=\"YouTube\">\n        </a>\n        <a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/bonsaistudios\">\n            <img width=\"10%\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/AEfwGvx.png\" alt=\"Kofi\">\n        </a>\n        <a href=\"https://mcmodels.net/vendors/29/joosh\">\n            <img width=\"10%\" src=\"https://imgur.com/pXWpwIb.png\" alt=\"Mcmodels\">\n        </a>\n    </center> <br>\n<div>",
